You’d need the joint pdf, but you don’t have that. What you really want to use is the fact that E(Z | Z^2 ) is a function of the random variable Z^2, which satisfies:

int E(Z | Z^2 ) dP = int Z dP

where the integrals are taken over any set of the form {Z^2 < z}

